From 7aca608ed771decf638b0ce372325e657a6f91f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:59:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] sapphire: qpnp-smb5, qpnp-qg: reconstruct the stock
 Xiaomi charger and gauge

qpnp-smb5-main: Xiaomi charger changes recovered from the stock module
(audio/touch/charging-policy exports with stock CRCs, MTBF/float/QC2
handling, Type-C debug accessory, apdo/audio_cctog sysfs, notifier chain),
struct smb_charger identical to stock (real_charger_type at 0x128c).
qpnp-qg: FFC iterm, soc decimal rate, shutdown delay, night charging and
cap learning like stock; stock pm_relax leak, missing work cancels and an
unchecked DT array read are fixed.

dt-bindings qti_power_supply_iio.h: restore the stock/topaz PSY_IIO
numbering (Xiaomi block from 0x7e, sapphire ids 0xb2-0xc5, 0xe9/0xea);
colliding newer CLO FG ids move to 0xf0+.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
